messages.en:
Whenever I go fishing,{01 00 00 0a 00} I set
my own rules, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.

{06 01 00 08 09 0a}

messages.et:
Alati kui kalale lähen,{01 00 00 0a 00} sean
endale reeglid, {01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}.

{06 01 00 08 09 0a}

messages.en:
{07 14 00}OK, {01 00 00 05 00}would you rather be
friends with a red fish,{01 00 00 0a 00}
blue fish,{01 00 00 0a 00} or white fish?{02 01 00 0c 0d 0e}
Red fish.
Blue fish.
White fish.

messages.et:
{07 14 00}Olgu, {01 00 00 05 00}kas sõbrustaksid
pigem punase kala,{01 00 00 0a 00}
sinise{01 00 00 0a 00} või valge kalaga?{02 01 00 0c 0d 0e}
Punane kala.
Sinine kala.
Valge kala.

messages.en:
{07 19 00}My fishing rule for today is
to only walk on grass{01 00 00 05 00} on
my way to the riverbank!{07 00 00}
{07 14 00}I'm not gonna walk on any
dirt whatsoever,{01 00 00 05 00}
{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 19 00}Tänane kalareegel on käia
ainult murul{01 00 00 05 00}, kui lähen
jõe äärde!{07 00 00}
{07 14 00}Ma ei astu üldse
mullale,{01 00 00 05 00}
{04 02 00}!

messages.en:
{07 0d 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Well, I'm fine with anything,{01 00 00 0a 00}
as long as it tastes good
breaded and fried!

messages.et:
{07 0d 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Noh, mulle sobib kõik,{01 00 00 0a 00}
kui see on riivsaias
praetuna maitsev!

messages.en:
{07 00 00}Red fish, huh?{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 13 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}I bet they're
red 'cause they're shy and
embarrassed!{01 00 00 05 00} That's cute!
{07 0a 00}They're just like me,{01 00 00 0a 00}
{04 02 00}!{03 01 00 01}

messages.et:
{07 00 00}Punane kala, mis?{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 13 00}{01 00 00 0a 00}Küllap on
nad punased, sest neil on
piinlik!{01 00 00 05 00} See on armas!
{07 0a 00}Nad on nagu mina,{01 00 00 0a 00}
{04 02 00}!{03 01 00 01}

messages.en:
{07 19 00}Yeah, white makes sense.{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 00 00}I mean, they seem nice,{01 00 00 05 00} and
they are pretty.
{07 0a 00}They're like swimming sugar
cookies or something,{01 00 00 0a 00}
{04 02 00}!

messages.et:
{07 19 00}Jah, valge on mõistlik.{01 00 00 14 00}
{07 00 00}Ma mõtlen, nad tunduvad
kenad{01 00 00 05 00} ja on ilusad.
{07 0a 00}Nad on nagu ujuvad
suhkruküpsised,{01 00 00 0a 00}
{04 02 00}!
